{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/6852391407ff50d6fe45419ef9707c88.avif?t=1756648938\" width=1140 height=257 /></span>Shotball is fast-paced, team-based shooter sport game where players use shotguns to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >football in explosive 3v3 matches, Build your ultimate loadout, use advanced movement to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >outplay your opponents and smash in goals with style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/1dda17dab48df17dee3f862cca1edbbf.webp?t=1756648938\" width=1140 height=53 /></span> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/16e827ef455ac9ecc9425851cdcb3085.poster.avif?t=1756648938\" width=568 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/16e827ef455ac9ecc9425851cdcb3085.webm?t=1756648938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forget everything you know about football, in Shotball everything is a target. Combining</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">precise shooting mechanics with competitive sports gameplay, every match is a chaotic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">dance of passing, blasting and scoring, The shotgun is your tool for offense, defense, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/b60029c40ef2844cd088379723b9b8de.poster.avif?t=1756648938\" width=568 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/b60029c40ef2844cd088379723b9b8de.webm?t=1756648938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Shotball\u2019s arenas are your playground. Chain wall runs, double jumps, slides, and air slides</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">to build unstoppable momentum and outpace your opponents. Every movement skill fuels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">your speed, letting you set up lightning-fast attacks, daring saves, and jaw-dropping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">highlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/7ae348bddcd292cbd092ec3403b63292.poster.avif?t=1756648938\" width=568 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/7ae348bddcd292cbd092ec3403b63292.webm?t=1756648938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two Loadouts fight the same in Shotball. With unique abilities, perks, and ultimates, you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">can tailor your loadout to match your playstyle, from agile goal-scorers to heavy-hitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">enforcers. Adapt your class, counter your rivals, and find your perfect strategy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/1dda17dab48df17dee3f862cca1edbbf.webp?t=1756648938\" width=1140 height=53 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Goals Scorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941100/462e72e33698f5b1ec835c6084393bde0d676193.jpg"},{"name":"Goals Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941100/462e72e33698f5b1ec835c6084393bde0d676193.jpg"},{"name":"Assists Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941100/462e72e33698f5b1ec835c6084393bde0d676193.jpg"},{"name":"Assists Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941100/462e72e33698f5b1ec835c6084393bde0d676193.jpg"},{"name":"Knockout Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941100/462e72e33698f5b1ec835c6084393bde0d676193.jpg"},{"name":"Knockout Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941100/462e72e33698f5b1ec835c6084393bde0d676193.jpg"},{"name":"Saves Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941100/462e72e33698f5b1ec835c6084393bde0d676193.jpg"},{"name":"Saves Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941100/462e72e33698f5b1ec835c6084393bde0d676193.jpg"},{"name":"Epic Saver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941100/462e72e33698f5b1ec835c6084393bde0d676193.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Baller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2941100/462e72e33698f5b1ec835c6084393bde0d676193.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2941100?t=1756648938","back