m; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forget everything you know about football, in Shotball everything is a target. Combining</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">precise shooting mechanics with competitive sports gameplay, every match is a chaotic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">dance of passing, blasting and scoring, The shotgun is your tool for offense, defense, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/b60029c40ef2844cd088379723b9b8de.poster.avif?t=1756648938\" width=568 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/b60029c40ef2844cd088379723b9b8de.webm?t=1756648938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Shotball\u2019s arenas are your playground. Chain wall runs, double jumps, slides, and air slides</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">to build unstoppable momentum and outpace your opponents. Every movement skill fuels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">your speed, letting you set up lightning-fast attacks, daring saves, and jaw-dropping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">highlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c